# JAAS Terraform Plan
# 
# This repository has been restructured to use a modular approach:
#
# - environments/ - Contains the top-level Terraform plan for deploying JAAS
# - modules/jaas  - Module for deploying the JAAS stack
#
# To deploy JAAS, navigate to the environments/ directory:
#   cd environments
#   terraform init
#   terraform plan
#   terraform apply
#
# See README.md for detailed instructions.
